      "published_at": "2013-04-15",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Priest of Titania's ability counts all Elves on the battlefield. This includes Priest of Titania itself as well as Elves controlled by other players.",
      "oracle_id": "3a198a16-17b9-481e-b516-5bc945c7e247",
      "published_at": "2024-06-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Priest of Titania's ability is a mana ability. It doesn't use the stack and players can't respond to it. Notably, this means other players can't try to remove Elves from the battlefield after you activate this ability but before it resolves.",
      "oracle_id": "3a198a16-17b9-481e-b516-5bc945c7e247",
      "published_at": "2024-06-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Battle Hymn uses the stack and can be responded to. The amount of mana produced is based on the number of creatures you control when Battle Hymn resolves.",
      "oracle_id": "4b977117-741c-4157-8fcf-719e475a8a4c",
      "published_at": "2012-05-01",
